      "text": "Continuation of increased-take-home-\npay plan during 1970-1971 fiscal\nyear, for City-paid officers and em-\nployees who are members of City-sup-\nported retirement systems and addi-\ntional provisions relating to the\nperiod October first, nineteen hundred\nsixty-eight through June thirtieth,\nnineteen hundred seventy for sanitation\nmembers other than sanitationmen.",
